  <item>
    <title>Vol007 职场新人对谈｜实习生&amp;新人职场融入&amp;职场社交&amp;新人避坑指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6487ceb16752b5f9de97a9b4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6487ceb16752b5f9de97a9b4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jun 2023 02:04:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位小伙伴好久不见！最近17&amp;15工作比较忙，鸽了一段时间。黏糊糊的夏天到了，校招&amp;实习入职的高峰也来了。对于每一个新人来说，初入职场意味着抛弃学生身份去社交和思考问题。作为曾是校招生入职，踩过坑的17和安全落地的15，这期节目想跟大家来聊聊我们经历，希望能够帮助大家缓解入职的紧张和焦虑，平稳度过实习&amp;入职尴尬期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：收到111听友群全面开通啦，欢迎大家扫描下方二维码加入群聊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWq6bGbOjWs27jORq2CrkAPe3zd.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>省点事儿</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>】初入职场，如何有效和mentor沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a>】别对mentor有滤镜！教你是情分，不教你是本分</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a>】打工而已，真别走心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a>】积极反馈，有事儿别自己扛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a>】死去的回忆突然攻击我：是不是每个新人都买过小蛋糕啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a>】打工要留痕！把无形工作有形化</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a>】校招生初入职，好开端VS一把烂牌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a>】职场真的需要立人设吗？什么是良好的职场人设？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2314">38:34</a>】别被外界的声音影响！多听听内心的选择！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2537">42:17</a>】打工而已，别委屈自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a>】决定能在一家公司能呆多久的核心要素：平级社交</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>话很多的两个人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>校招入职后遭遇危机一路跌跌撞撞的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>校招入职表现亮眼平稳落地的15</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>是谁在唱歌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Stephen Sanchez - Until I Found You</span></p><span></span><p><span>WNRDA - Baby Can You Stay</span></p><span></span><p><span>有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系</span><em><strong><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
