  <item>
    <title>Vol.006 对话梧桐区咖啡游民：别管我了，让我在舒适圈里呆着吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641ff20a179eec53315c31a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641ff20a179eec53315c31a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Mar 2023 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>收到111读者群开放啦！欢迎大家扫描下方二维码入群唠嗑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒省点事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>】为什么会想做咖啡师？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a>】隐藏在餐饮行业的性别歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a>】咖啡行业薪资水平，正职&amp;兼职收入对比</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a>】咖啡小白如何低成本入行</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a>】速溶&amp;冻干&amp;现磨咖啡的区别，作为消费者如何选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a>】咖啡行业卷吗？咖啡师真的是躺平党的天堂吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a>】是谁一直在假装努力？啊是我们东亚人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a>】宝，别焦虑了，人生还有很大的下降空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2396">39:56</a>】爸爸妈妈！我也很想给你们开一扇窗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a>】坐上时光机，你会回到哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a>】咖啡游民最爱的咖啡店</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚Reference</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>咖啡师推荐的沪上咖啡馆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Alt Coffee（上海老阿姨的日式咖啡店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>村口大树（热门网红店，推荐特调）</span></p><span></span><p><span>集雅（发呆爱好者必去）</span></p><span></span><p><span>旺达（推荐手冲）</span></p><span></span><p><span>雨山（咖啡师心中的top咖啡店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙话很多的两个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>初入职场1年却已经心如死灰的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂和数据打交道的品牌人15</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤是谁在唱歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wild Child - Crazy Bird</span></p><span></span><p><span>小洋槐乐队 - Life Is Noise</span></p><span></span><p><span>Walker Hayes - Don't Let Her</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、扫码入群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWq6bGbOjWs27jORq2CrkAPe3zd.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系</span><em><strong><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
