    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f7701179d1c9aec85d6800</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Feb 2023 13:54:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>热烈庆祝收到111粉丝</span><strong><span>破百</span></strong><span>啦！两位“菜鸟”主播在此非常感谢大家对我们小破播客的支持！从本期节目开始我们会开通收到111“到友”听众群，感兴趣的朋友们可以扫描文末</span><strong><span>二维码</span></strong><span>加入群聊，等你一起聊职场八卦，吐槽SB老板！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒省点事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a>】春天来了，春招还会远吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a>】秋招上岸了？别着急，万一有更好的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>】精投VS海投？哪个更好？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a>】主动出击，多渠道降低信息差</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a>】揭秘大厂HR筛选简历的逻辑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a>】只要心态好，门口就是巴厘岛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>】除了校招，还有这些手段，也能找到活儿干！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a>】只有大厂才是好工作吗！漏！适合自己才是最好的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a>】面试的唯一法宝：自信！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a>】手把手教你如何在面试时发现垃圾公司！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a>】厕所是一家公司的风向标</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙话很多的两个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>初入职场1年却已经心如死灰的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂和数据打交道的品牌人15</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚Reference</span></p><span></span><p><span>公司避坑资讯—脉脉</span></p><span></span><p><span>刷题找内推—牛客</span></p><span></span><p><span>求职招聘信息—Top高校的就业服务公众号、各付费收集招聘信息公众号</span></p><span></span><p><span>国企招聘—国聘、各地本地宝公众号</span></p><span></span><p><span>小公司集合地—boss直聘、拉勾网</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤是谁在唱歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>BELL WARISARA - มา Strong ข้างกัน</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part Time Musicians - The Only One</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、扫码入群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-GoRuowdTqIqQoA80yei-74sdW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系：</span><em><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></em></p>]]></description>
