    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📒省点事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a>】看到学弟学妹们的简历：孩子们，公司配不上你</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a>】看脸的时代，真的很要命</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>】手把手教大家要薪资！要敢谈钱！因为职场没人谈感情</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">09:17</a>】不要给自己贴标签！向学历自卑、外貌自卑say no！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a>】在别人的简历里，窥见自己的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a>】校招刚进公司？别焦虑！做你自己！你值得所有美好的一切！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a>】面试间隙刷小红书，居然发现有同学在吐槽我？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a>】接offer避雷：小心进去做了炮灰</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a>】不要让他人的情绪，影响你的判断</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a>】从面试官的视角来看面试：多面多复盘，做个渣男！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a>】秋招哪有不发疯的呀！扭曲！爬行！艰难地爬行！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙话很多的两个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>初入职场1年却已经心如死灰的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂和数据打交道的品牌人15</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤是谁在唱歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>新裤子-你都忘了你有多美</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈婧霏-海底一公里</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、加听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg7ksikW0t1HseTz9ZlswHi1ReI7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系</span></p><span></span><p><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期节目传送门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63256191953e23f946ae9725" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63256191953e23f946ae9725">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.co