    <title>Vol.003 职场菜鸟看跃入高阶职场：就这？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6384a291f6753f4e9d4d5a7f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6384a291f6753f4e9d4d5a7f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Nov 2022 11:59:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《跃上高阶职场》是由腾讯视频出品的轻熟龄职场观察类真人秀，由马伊琍、毛晓彤、杨天真、陈铭、徐志胜、何同学担任“跃升见证团”固定成员。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目以广告行业为背景，不再聚焦职场应届新人，而是直击30岁左右轻熟龄职场人的痛点，还原跃升过程中真实的职场竞争生态</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目，两位职场菜鸟：正统广告专业出身毕业后却毅然决定去甲方的15及曾饱受乙方之苦的17，想和大家聊聊看完节目后的感受。愿听到这期的朋友们，也能找到自己的职场生存法则，跃上高阶职场。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【防杠指南】：本期节目中对所有嘉宾的讨论仅代表个人观点，求轻喷～</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒省点事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a>】4A公司？写字楼百亿，实习工资50</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a>】致奇葩甲方：花钱了不起啊？甲方：不好意思，确实了不起</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a>】90后整顿职场！西方思维VS东方思维，谁会赢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a>】打工人们！别做包子！勇敢发声！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a>】好老板可遇不可求，聊聊节目中的天花板老板！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a>】职场老鸟：原来打工也有“七年之痒”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a>】打工人楷模！八月！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">40:37</a>】你们都去逃离舒适圈吧！让我在圈里呆着！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">49:08</a>】初入职场，千万别做“乖乖女”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3257">54:17</a>】15：啊！非凡！是你让我找到了初心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖Reference</span></p><span></span><p><span>腾讯视频：《跃上高阶职场》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️话很多的两个</span></p><span></span><p><span>初入职场1年却已经心如死灰的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂和数据打交道的品牌人15</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤是谁在唱歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>新裤子 - 你都忘了你有多美</span></p><span></span><p><span>品冠-门没锁</span></p><span></span><p><span>로지(ROZY) &nbsp;- 가자 (TO THE SEA)</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、扫码入群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrvVTCyfn8TdpkVnDhHDOf0ibwO4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/63205b06f3d15f16f4cc33ae/create/shoudao111@outlook.com" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/63205b06f3d15f16f4cc33ae/create/shoudao111@outlook.com"><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
