    <guid isPermaLink="false">63651b058ba1d6f3e83a63ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Nov 2022 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上一期节目中，作为“小镇错题家”的17和15和大家分享了自己艰难且抓马的秋招历程。节目播出后，我们在后台收到了很多小伙伴的留言，大家或多或少都表达了自己关于秋招的焦虑与不安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目，作为social达人的</span><em><strong><span>ENFJ</span></strong></em><span>“可爱小狗”15和身为“小老头儿”的</span><em><strong><span>INFJ </span></strong></em><span>17想和大家聊聊初入职场时遇到的“大无语”事件。相信在听过这档播客后，你一定会大喊一声：</span><em><strong><span>好好的人！上什么班呀！让秋招都去死吧！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>📒省点事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a>】Social好难！ENFJ快乐小狗在利益场里直接歇菜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a>】我不理解！职场弯弯绕真的好多耶！INFJ小老头点个奶茶却被老人打成抱团！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a>】初入职场，只在自己的舒适圈里社交有错嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>】和乙方代理吃饭，某ENFJ：城市套路深，我想回农村！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a>】INFJ被合作方塞一张购物卡后：独自在脑海里演完了一整部反腐剧......</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a>】舔还是不舔？我的老板！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a>】啊！INFJ们！我们真是一群悲伤的小老头啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a>】职场王牌法则。第一：不要脸；第二：坚持不要脸！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2816">46:56</a>】秋什么招啊！没找到工作是最大的福报！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a>】新人职场防坑宝典！不听后悔一百年（不是）!</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤是谁在唱歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>新裤子 - 你都忘了你有多美</span></p><span></span><p><span>10CM - 그라데이션</span></p><span></span><p><span>Halcyon- BLÜ EYES</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️话很多的两个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>初入职场1年却已经心如死灰的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂和数据打交道的品牌人15</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、扫码入群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrvVTCyfn8TdpkVnDhHDOf0ibwO4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
