  <item>
    <title>Vol.001 秋招进行时，两位“小镇错题家”的找工作之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63256191953e23f946ae9725</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63256191953e23f946ae9725</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Sep 2022 05:56:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一年校招时，在疫情、封锁、经济下行乌云下的2022更是堪称“最难秋招季”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目，两个没背景、中低学历的“小镇错题家”想和大家聊聊我们艰难而又抓马的校招和实习之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望收听这一期节目的你，能够放下焦虑，找工作顺利。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📒省点儿事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a>】“小镇做题家”？不！我们是小镇“错题家”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a>】又收到大厂秋招推文，痛苦的回忆再次袭击我</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a>】“资深”实习生17：我也就5678段抓马实习吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a>】“非诚勿扰”式面试，面对强劲嘉宾，如何不被灭灯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a>】有幸去大厂实习，我却每天都很自卑</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a>】离开大厂后，我转道去了家“同性交友APP”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a>】22届秋招上岸广告生15：实习一行，放弃一行</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a>】幻想破裂！电视台实习，治好了我的“追星病”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a>】放弃保研，想做一些“非政治正确”的事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">41:09</a>】跌跌撞撞校招路，心态宛如过山车</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2494">41:34</a>】有些钱，该花还得花</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">47:04</a>】终于收到大厂面试机会，却被狠狠“PUA”</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3009">50:09</a>】这是可以说的吗？小宇宙爸爸</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3277">54:37</a>】来自两位“小镇错题家”的不成熟校招建议</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>话很多的两个人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>初入职场1年却已经心如死灰的17</span></p><span></span><p><span>疯狂和数据打交道的品牌人15</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>是谁在唱歌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>新裤子 - 你都忘了你有多美</span></p><span></span><p><span>Audrey Mika - Y U Gotta B Like That</span></p><span></span><p><span>로지(ROZY) &nbsp;- 가자 (TO THE SEA)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关单集传送门</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6397314f3a2b7eba5ceb4530" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6397314f3a2b7eba5ceb4530">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a> Vol.1.1在秋招之后：面了80个校招生后，我悟了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📪联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1、扫码入群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrvVTCyfn8TdpkVnDhHDOf0ibwO4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、有任何建议or想在播客里听到的话题，欢迎联系</span></p><span></span><p><span>shoudao111@outlook.com</span></p>]]></description>
